# UI Component Conventions

## General
- Use Vercel Design Guidelines (see AGENTS.md)
- Prefer semantic HTML; add `aria-label` for icon-only buttons
- Loading states: append `…` (e.g. "Send…", "Loading…")
- Placeholders: end with `…` and show example pattern

## Generative Components
- Use `useReducedMotion()` from framer-motion for accessibility
- Animate only `opacity` and `transform`; never layout props
- Empty states: show helpful message with recovery path
- Cards: consistent `rounded-2xl`, `shadow-sm` for hierarchy

## Chat
- Chat input: `text-base` (≥16px) for mobile
- Suggested prompts: `min-h-[44px]` on mobile for touch targets
- Error messages: `aria-live="polite"` for screen readers
- Links in `<a>` or `<Link>`; never `<button>` for navigation
